7
00:00:09,450 --> 00:00:13,464
Primero, los valores normales:

8
00:00:13,464 --> 00:00:17,611
pH de 7.35 a 7.45; PaCO₂ de 35 a

9
00:00:17,611 --> 00:00:21,401
