50
00:01:52,530 --> 00:01:54,672
Pongámoslo a prueba:

51
00:01:54,672 --> 00:01:57,941
pH 7.25, PaCO₂ 30 y bicarbonato

52
00:01:57,941 --> 00:02:01,862
14. Hay acidemia, y el pH y el

53
00:02:01,862 --> 00:02:04,368
